- image_to_video: image-to-video
- first_last_frame: first and last frame to video
- reference_to_video: reference-to-video', example='text_to_video'),
  model?: string(name='Model', description='The model name. Valid values:

- happyhorse-1.1
- happyhorse-1.0
- wan2.7', example='happyhorse-1.1'),
  n?: int32(name='N', description='The number of outputs. Valid values: 1 to 4. Default value: 1.', example='1'),
